    "section": "Mission Sequence",
    "summary": "The Attacker and Defender each have a deck with the same selection of Secondary Missions for earning extra VP. Both players secretly record whether they will use the Fixed or Tactical method. A player choosing Fixed records two missions before the choices are revealed. You can leave out secondaries for an introductory game. For tournament and other formats, consult the official Warhammer 40,000 app.",
